# Eval harness fixture (MILE-29): tracked FILES are intentionally committed by
# the outer repo (ROADMAP.md, PROJECT.md, .planning/STATE.md, etc.) -- only the
# fixture's own NESTED .git/ internals are excluded, so the outer repo never
# treats it as a submodule-like blob. The .planning/ negation below is required
# because the blanket ".planning/" rule above otherwise matches at any depth.
